  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of the Bolivian Representatives Chamber of Congress</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the grant would be to strengthen the House of Deputies&apos; Budget Committee for more effective conflict resolution and dissemination of public information, particularly in areas related with budget processes and public expenditure. This, by strengthening the institutional capacities of the Congress in this area, extending the international experience and best practices in parliamentary programs to Bolivia&apos;s Congress, and consolidating the Global Legal Information Network (GLIN). The grant would therefore support Government&apos;s efforts to increase budget transparency and accountability by opening up and making public information available to the citizens, especially, by presenting and disseminating to the citizens adequate information about the nature of the fiscal problems facing the country.  To achieve this objective, the grant would support the Congress in creating a Center for Research and Information which main objective will be the strengthening of the Budget Committee.  This task is being co-mananged with Ms. Beatriz Merino TF # To strengthen the technical capacity of the Recipient#s House of Deputies Budget Committee to achieve dissemination of public information, particularly in areas related to budget processes and public expenditures, to increase budget transparency and accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
